    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52e7f83fe384aae7905a3464",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "除此以外我还准备了、\n『二重吐息』和『飞脚跑法』之类的技巧！\n我想给你都过目一遍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb0def732a9b982c28585878133bb0476d27fffdda49c4c1f5f9c2815d51777f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
