      "uid": "zhcn:7b10f423df39d6df161fcf3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，神业接二连三地展示了新的创意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4da86cd0d1332c0bbbc6b5db9540729046efdf3174394b7f9efbdb4b17ba3521",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
