      "uid": "zhcn:c7ca9e511bfb36ffb8760518",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我原以为如何应对这份天赐的才能\n就是自己的工作――",
      "source_fingerprint": "36a71983005a490f681695cb0c26779009b75e36c9baaa62777e2f5d311b5a55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
